    %s [options] [query]
    %s [query] [options]
    %s [options] [query] [options]

    Options:
      -c, --continue
        Open recent shows. With no query this screen is the default.
        Typing there searches. mpv resumes the saved position.
      -d, --download
        Download the video instead of playing it
